WEBVTT

00:00:01.615 --> 00:00:13.493
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.627 --> 00:00:19.199
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:19.199 --> 00:00:26.105
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:37.642
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.851 --> 00:00:43.790
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:51.196
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:59.005
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:59.005 --> 00:01:05.879
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.879 --> 00:01:11.485
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.485 --> 00:01:17.724
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.724 --> 00:01:26.189
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:34.408 --> 00:01:38.208
She's the person you were
one lifetime before Serafine.

00:01:41.915 --> 00:01:43.678
Christina...

00:01:52.893 --> 00:01:55.829
Teacher! Miss Christina!

00:01:55.829 --> 00:01:57.931
Teacher! Miss Christina!
YEAR 1749

00:01:57.931 --> 00:01:58.955
YEAR 1749

00:02:00.867 --> 00:02:04.826
SPAIN. OLAND ISLAND

00:02:16.082 --> 00:02:21.019
RETURN, INTO THE MIST

00:02:29.963 --> 00:02:32.899
Ah, you're embroidering the
same thing again, huh?

00:02:32.899 --> 00:02:35.035
Hey, hey! Teacher!

00:02:35.035 --> 00:02:38.596
This time I get that
handkerchief, right?

00:02:56.189 --> 00:02:59.426
Miss Christina! This is no good!

00:02:59.426 --> 00:03:01.792
The pot is going to burn, Teacher!

00:03:02.295 --> 00:03:06.231
Come on, hurry! The color of
the perovskia is coming out!

00:03:24.351 --> 00:03:26.376
How is it, Teacher?

00:03:26.653 --> 00:03:28.989
Well, Arnon...

00:03:28.989 --> 00:03:32.492
The color of perovskia is a beautiful,
light blue but...

00:03:32.492 --> 00:03:34.494
But the blue I see
in my memories

00:03:34.494 --> 00:03:37.731
is a darker and crisper blue.

00:03:37.731 --> 00:03:39.699
Like the lilia flower, right?

00:03:39.699 --> 00:03:42.998
The lilia is a very pretty, blue flower
that blossoms on the rocky cliffs.

00:03:43.637 --> 00:03:46.172
Arnon, you know a lot about
them, don't you?

00:03:46.172 --> 00:03:49.109
Well, you're always talking
about them, Teacher.

00:03:49.109 --> 00:03:53.546
You say that the blue lilia flower
rarely blooms around here.

00:03:53.613 --> 00:03:56.816
But, you know, right around this time
of the season, after it rains,

00:03:56.816 --> 00:03:59.910
sometimes they'll grow in
clusters and blossom.

00:04:15.669 --> 00:04:19.070
Shall I go and get those
flowers for you?

00:04:19.506 --> 00:04:21.107
No, Arnon!

00:04:21.107 --> 00:04:23.777
Those flowers blossom in a
very dangerous place.

00:04:23.777 --> 00:04:26.746
You absolutely mustn't go!
Do you understand?

00:04:26.746 --> 00:04:27.781
But...

00:04:27.781 --> 00:04:32.241
Please, Arnon. Just the fact that
you want to makes me very happy.

00:04:36.456 --> 00:04:39.857
Teacher, you have such a
sad look in your eyes.

00:04:43.229 --> 00:04:45.665
You've probably been separated
from the person you love

00:04:45.665 --> 00:04:48.429
and can't forget about
them, right?

00:04:50.036 --> 00:04:52.038
Arnon...

00:04:52.038 --> 00:04:54.441
If I was a grown-up,

00:04:54.441 --> 00:04:58.901
there are so many things
I would be able to do for you.

00:04:59.879 --> 00:05:03.474
If I was a grown-up,
I would be able to protect you!

00:05:11.024 --> 00:05:13.193
The poor thing.

00:05:13.193 --> 00:05:16.997
Early this morning, he went to the
western cliffs and fell off.

00:05:16.997 --> 00:05:21.167
You know how much it rained yesterday.
It seems he slipped and fell.

00:05:21.167 --> 00:05:25.627
Why would he go to a place like
that? And when it was still dark.

00:05:25.939 --> 00:05:28.134
Who knows?

00:05:33.246 --> 00:05:36.683
According to the priest,
when they found him,

00:05:36.683 --> 00:05:41.187
Arnon was holding a lot of
lilia flowers in his arms.

00:05:41.187 --> 00:05:43.712
Really?

00:05:49.496 --> 00:05:50.986
Lilia...

00:05:52.365 --> 00:05:55.698
Arnon... Arnon!

00:06:05.111 --> 00:06:08.080
Arnon! Arnon!

00:06:09.082 --> 00:06:11.073
Arnon!

00:06:15.555 --> 00:06:17.682
Arnon!

00:06:22.996 --> 00:06:24.987
Arnon! Arnon!

00:06:26.032 --> 00:06:29.602
Teacher, you have such a
sad look in your eyes.

00:06:29.602 --> 00:06:31.971
If I was a grown-up,

00:06:31.971 --> 00:06:35.839
there are so many things
I would be able to do for you.

00:06:36.242 --> 00:06:39.507
Arnon... For my sake...

00:06:45.218 --> 00:06:48.779
Seth! Seth!

00:06:49.222 --> 00:06:51.918
Seth! Seth!

00:06:54.094 --> 00:06:57.495
Seth! Seth...

00:07:00.366 --> 00:07:01.697
Seth?

00:07:08.141 --> 00:07:09.972
Seth?

00:07:15.248 --> 00:07:16.840
Seth?

00:07:25.325 --> 00:07:27.427
What's the matter?

00:07:27.427 --> 00:07:29.861
You're lost, aren't you?

00:07:33.166 --> 00:07:35.430
Are you afraid of me?

00:07:57.924 --> 00:08:00.085
I'll take you home.

00:08:11.371 --> 00:08:13.973
-What's your name?
-Tina!

00:08:13.973 --> 00:08:15.742
Tina, huh?

00:08:15.742 --> 00:08:18.711
Why are you wearing a mask?

00:08:19.445 --> 00:08:21.936
This isn't a mask.

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.822
My feet hurt!

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:35.791
Come on.

00:09:25.778 --> 00:09:28.314
Tina! Tina!

00:09:28.314 --> 00:09:29.716
It's Seth!

00:09:29.716 --> 00:09:32.118
Seth! Seth!

00:09:32.118 --> 00:09:33.642
Seth!

00:09:33.987 --> 00:09:36.251
Seth!

00:09:36.522 --> 00:09:38.358
You shouldn't do that, Tina!

00:09:38.358 --> 00:09:39.626
Where did you go?

00:09:39.626 --> 00:09:45.030
I'm sorry, but that boy
in the mask brought me...

00:09:46.366 --> 00:09:48.101
Huh?

00:09:48.101 --> 00:09:50.136
Come on, let's go home.

00:09:50.136 --> 00:09:53.628
If we get back too late,
Father will scold us.

00:10:13.493 --> 00:10:14.928
Seth!

00:10:14.928 --> 00:10:17.230
Seth! Seth!

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:18.531
Seth!

00:10:18.531 --> 00:10:20.867
Princess! Where are you going?

00:10:20.867 --> 00:10:23.358
I'm looking for Seth!

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:26.766
Father, do you know where Seth...

00:10:27.674 --> 00:10:29.275
Well, Tina...

00:10:29.275 --> 00:10:32.403
You've become quite beautiful
since I last saw you.

00:10:35.281 --> 00:10:40.286
Say Tina... Could you talk to
your father for me?

00:10:40.286 --> 00:10:43.957
Ask him to try and understand
his younger brother's feelings a bit.

00:10:43.957 --> 00:10:47.154
He's such a stubborn older
brother, I can't talk to him.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:50.430
But since you can do
no wrong in his eyes,

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:53.365
if you say something,
he might actually listen.

00:10:53.599 --> 00:10:56.534
How about it, Tina?

00:11:04.477 --> 00:11:07.310
Father! Father!

00:11:07.714 --> 00:11:09.615
Well, well!

00:11:09.615 --> 00:11:13.453
With my soon-to-be
16-year-old daughter

00:11:13.453 --> 00:11:16.322
running around as if
she were a palace soldier,

00:11:16.322 --> 00:11:18.858
I won't be marrying her off
any time soon!

00:11:18.858 --> 00:11:23.727
Now then, come over here,
my adorable Tina.

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:26.128
Father, you're teasing me!

00:11:28.001 --> 00:11:30.670
I just ran into Uncle outside.

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:33.002
I hate him so much!

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:37.543
Oh, Gotto!
I was looking for Seth.

00:11:37.543 --> 00:11:41.781
Princess, if you're looking for my son,
he should be in the courtyard,

00:11:41.781 --> 00:11:44.951
sparring or some such thing with
members of the royal guard.

00:11:44.951 --> 00:11:47.453
Humph! Leaving me all alone!

00:11:47.453 --> 00:11:48.955
Tina!

00:11:48.955 --> 00:11:53.459
Oh dear... It seems I've brought
her up to be a tomboy, Gotto.

00:11:53.459 --> 00:11:55.395
What are you talking about?

00:11:55.395 --> 00:11:57.597
Considering that you brought
her up all on your own,

00:11:57.597 --> 00:12:00.933
she's a very forthright and
sweet-natured princess.

00:12:00.933 --> 00:12:04.070
And my son seems to love
Princess Tina just the way she is.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:07.540
Gotto, you also have a
very good son.

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:10.109
If Tina and Seth get married,

00:12:10.109 --> 00:12:13.446
my duty as a father
will at last be over,

00:12:13.446 --> 00:12:16.082
and I can live my remaining years
in peace.

00:12:16.082 --> 00:12:20.485
Yes, but... The actions of your
younger brother Lord Gueroca are...

00:12:22.221 --> 00:12:24.457
He says he wants me to

00:12:24.457 --> 00:12:27.727
unconditionally cede half the
territory in the western region.

00:12:27.727 --> 00:12:29.962
But why now?

00:12:29.962 --> 00:12:32.065
I don't know. And recently,

00:12:32.065 --> 00:12:35.668
I've heard that some troubling people
have been gathering around him.

00:12:35.668 --> 00:12:37.837
Gotto, we must be careful.

00:12:37.837 --> 00:12:39.828
Yes, I understand.

00:12:46.879 --> 00:12:49.677
Seth! Seth!

00:12:55.621 --> 00:12:59.216
Seth! Letting yourself be distracted
by a woman was careless!

00:13:00.493 --> 00:13:03.121
When the woman is Tina,
it can't be helped!

00:13:03.596 --> 00:13:05.198
Hey, Tina!

00:13:05.198 --> 00:13:08.601
Oh, Seth! I've been looking
all over for you!

00:13:08.601 --> 00:13:10.728
Sorry, sorry.

00:13:10.937 --> 00:13:12.371
It's just I met a good friend
I haven't seen in a while,

00:13:12.371 --> 00:13:15.169
and I lost track of time.

00:13:19.011 --> 00:13:20.746
You've never met before, right?

00:13:20.746 --> 00:13:23.943
This is my best friend, a palace guard
regiment commander, Soran.

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:30.514
The boy in the mask!

00:13:36.028 --> 00:13:38.724
The boy in the mask!

00:13:42.802 --> 00:13:46.169
Tina, wasn't there something
you needed?

00:13:47.406 --> 00:13:50.603
Oh... What was it again?

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:53.446
Seth, go back ahead of me!

00:13:53.446 --> 00:13:55.437
What's that about?

00:13:56.749 --> 00:13:59.274
Please wait!
Wait!

00:14:02.788 --> 00:14:04.757
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:14:04.757 --> 00:14:07.059
Um, don't you remember me?

00:14:07.059 --> 00:14:09.795
You know, I was lost in the
forest in a heavy mist

00:14:09.795 --> 00:14:13.788
and you took me back
close to the palace.

00:14:15.501 --> 00:14:18.671
I wanted to thank you
for that.

00:14:18.671 --> 00:14:21.073
It's all right if you
don't remember it.

00:14:21.073 --> 00:14:23.769
I've thought about it
ever since.

00:14:42.628 --> 00:14:44.830
Hesma, how are the readings
from the Zone?

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:46.766
They're good! It's stable.

00:14:46.766 --> 00:14:48.801
We should be able to
hold it back for 15 minutes.

00:14:48.801 --> 00:14:50.970
The marmot has been brain-dead
for 5 minutes.

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:52.738
How's the Orsel interference?

00:14:52.738 --> 00:14:54.574
230 stilbs!

00:14:54.574 --> 00:14:58.442
It's fine. With this amount of
radiance, we can maintain stability.

00:14:59.979 --> 00:15:01.814
You're late, Palza! Mel!

00:15:01.814 --> 00:15:03.805
I'm sorry, Aghi!

00:15:06.586 --> 00:15:08.321
Injection complete, Aghi!

00:15:08.321 --> 00:15:10.551
Okay! Let's start!

00:15:23.369 --> 00:15:25.360
It's coming!

00:15:36.282 --> 00:15:38.884
Our success rate is
definitely going up.

00:15:38.884 --> 00:15:41.988
Reincarnation after death using
spirit waves imprinted with a living thing,

00:15:41.988 --> 00:15:44.023
is just about proven possible.

00:15:44.023 --> 00:15:48.160
So now, we're one step closer to
reincarnating a body using the Zone?

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:51.197
No, we're still a long way from
reincarnating a human body.

00:15:51.197 --> 00:15:53.563
It's just a matter of time.

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:58.935
Is this what the Zone we discovered
is supposed to be used for?

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.870
I'm not so sure.

00:16:05.111 --> 00:16:06.746
Palza...

00:16:06.746 --> 00:16:08.648
I understand, Palza.

00:16:08.648 --> 00:16:11.450
The king has also told us
to be extremely careful

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:13.753
when dealing with the Zone
of death.

00:16:13.753 --> 00:16:17.023
Well, it's not surprising that
Palza is worried.

00:16:17.023 --> 00:16:20.159
You don't want anything to
ruin your future happiness, right?

00:16:20.159 --> 00:16:21.861
When is the wedding?

00:16:21.861 --> 00:16:25.564
Princess Tina will be
sixteen in 3 months.

00:16:25.564 --> 00:16:28.200
And it's rumored that her
wedding is also not far off.

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:31.431
Maybe Palza and Mel should get
married at the same time she does.

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:39.178
Look.

00:16:39.178 --> 00:16:41.480
The constellation shining
in the eastern sky

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:43.683
and the constellation shining
in the western sky

00:16:43.683 --> 00:16:47.779
were once lovers who lived
in the land of the gods.

00:16:48.254 --> 00:16:52.091
One day, the lovers angered
the gods and were separated.

00:16:52.091 --> 00:16:54.794
They were turned into constellations
in the heavens.

00:16:54.794 --> 00:16:58.230
And then, they were only allowed
to meet at this time of year.

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:00.221
For just a fleeting moment.

00:17:01.867 --> 00:17:05.871
I wonder if our experiments
will anger the gods.

00:17:05.871 --> 00:17:08.741
Palza, that's a myth!

00:17:08.741 --> 00:17:13.110
We're going to get married soon
and be together forever.

00:17:13.279 --> 00:17:15.611
Mel...

00:17:19.185 --> 00:17:20.886
Those constellations

00:17:20.886 --> 00:17:24.879
probably also want to be
together for all eternity.

00:17:29.128 --> 00:17:32.928
That's a good one, Captain!
Next time, I'll take you on!

00:17:32.998 --> 00:17:35.592
Honestly!
They certainly have it easy!

00:17:36.502 --> 00:17:40.005
Apparently, those are the soldiers who
are supposed to protect our palace.

00:17:40.005 --> 00:17:42.269
Look at that body!

00:17:46.312 --> 00:17:49.548
A man who can't even protect himself
is a commander in the palace guard

00:17:49.548 --> 00:17:51.914
that's supposed to protect us!

00:17:52.418 --> 00:17:54.854
Commoners are chosen to be
in the palace guard.

00:17:54.854 --> 00:17:56.756
I suppose he must be good.

00:17:56.756 --> 00:17:59.384
Do a good job protecting us.

00:18:00.659 --> 00:18:02.294
If you keep talking...

00:18:02.294 --> 00:18:04.319
-Stop it!
-But, Captain!

00:18:11.103 --> 00:18:14.266
-Princess!
-Let's go, come on!

00:18:50.109 --> 00:18:52.311
It happened when I was
5 years old.

00:18:52.311 --> 00:18:55.714
My father was taking me with him,
running all through the night,

00:18:55.714 --> 00:18:58.217
going to a nearby province.

00:18:58.217 --> 00:19:01.086
We heard people talking about
a revolt against the palace,

00:19:01.086 --> 00:19:02.822
saying it was their last chance.

00:19:02.822 --> 00:19:05.382
We headed there as fast as
we could.

00:19:06.258 --> 00:19:08.761
What could a 5-year-old
child do?

00:19:08.761 --> 00:19:11.096
If you think about it,
it was stupid.

00:19:11.096 --> 00:19:15.201
But at the time, my father was so
eager he couldn't understand that.

00:19:15.201 --> 00:19:18.864
If he distinguished himself,
he'd get a position in the royal palace.

00:19:18.971 --> 00:19:21.565
He kept telling me that
over and over.

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:26.412
But...

00:19:26.412 --> 00:19:29.813
In a bombardment fired by
rebel forces, I was...

00:19:30.816 --> 00:19:32.685
Did it hurt?

00:19:32.685 --> 00:19:36.021
I don't know.
I was little.

00:19:36.021 --> 00:19:37.823
And your father?

00:19:37.823 --> 00:19:39.959
He's already passed away.

00:19:39.959 --> 00:19:42.894
He died saying, "I'm sorry.
I'm sorry."

00:20:00.546 --> 00:20:03.048
You've been avoiding me
a lot lately, haven't you?

00:20:03.048 --> 00:20:05.584
No, that's not it...

00:20:05.584 --> 00:20:07.486
Are you trying to spare
my feelings?!

00:20:07.486 --> 00:20:09.477
If so, that makes me
even more angry!

00:20:10.456 --> 00:20:13.755
Is that the kind of man
you think I am?!

00:20:15.127 --> 00:20:18.864
Listen, Soran!
I have always protected Tina.

00:20:18.864 --> 00:20:22.134
Not because she's the fiancé the
king and my father chose for me!

00:20:22.134 --> 00:20:24.370
I swore in my heart that
I would protect Tina all my life

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:27.362
when I was a little boy!

00:20:28.807 --> 00:20:32.244
That Tina has fallen in love
with you, my best friend.

00:20:32.244 --> 00:20:35.581
Listen, Soran! Don't worry about the
fact that you're just a soldier!

00:20:35.581 --> 00:20:38.017
No, I'm not saying this
for your sake!

00:20:38.017 --> 00:20:40.952
I'm saying it for Tina's sake
as well as my own!

00:20:43.756 --> 00:20:46.992
Up until now,
I've protected Tina.

00:20:46.992 --> 00:20:50.393
From now on, you will
protect her!

00:20:50.529 --> 00:20:52.331
Seth...

00:20:52.331 --> 00:20:56.302
On the other hand, if you ever make
her unhappy, I'll never forgive you!

00:20:56.302 --> 00:20:58.770
You understand, right, Soran?

00:21:00.205 --> 00:21:01.797
Yes.

00:21:08.547 --> 00:21:10.742
Seth! Seth!

00:21:12.184 --> 00:21:13.352
Seth!

00:21:13.352 --> 00:21:15.754
Hey, hey! Aren't you hugging
the wrong person?

00:21:15.754 --> 00:21:18.724
Soran told me.
Thank you, Seth!

00:21:18.724 --> 00:21:21.894
Tina, listen.
Listen to me carefully.

00:21:21.894 --> 00:21:24.029
The hard part has only
just begun.

00:21:24.029 --> 00:21:27.700
You have to tell your father
about this.

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:31.693
You understand, right?
And I'll help you.

00:21:31.971 --> 00:21:35.532
Your happiness is the
most important thing to me.

00:21:37.676 --> 00:21:39.940
Tina...

00:21:50.823 --> 00:21:54.452
Tina, I will live my life
for your sake.

00:22:09.008 --> 00:22:11.704
Ti... na...

00:22:35.734 --> 00:22:45.336
At the bottom of a deep
shimmering sea,

00:22:45.811 --> 00:22:55.118
A tiny flower rests,

00:22:55.721 --> 00:23:04.959
A sweet wind's even sweeter song
passes through a rainbow,

00:23:05.698 --> 00:23:14.740
And fish, rising from the bottom,
seem to flutter on the horizon.

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:19.745
Everyone is singing love's melody,

00:23:19.745 --> 00:23:24.950
A warm light streams from the sky,

00:23:24.950 --> 00:23:30.022
And the sun's yellow gaze,
unbound and full,

00:23:30.022 --> 00:23:38.623
